# Plan Governance

Use skills `create-plan` and `execute-approved-plan`.

A required plan is a contract. It must include Task, Goal, Context, Constraints, Risks, and Stages. Each stage needs objective, allowed_paths, implementation work, verification, and completion criteria.

Do not implement PLAN_REQUIRED or HIGH_RISK work from a DRAFT plan. A human must run `approve-plan`. Editing PLAN.md invalidates approval. Do not write a giant plan without stages.
